    of each element of ``x``, promoting to inexact dtype.

  Note:
    - ``jnp.arccosh`` returns ``nan`` for real-values in the range ``[-inf, 1)``.
    - ``jnp.arccosh`` follows the branch cut convention of :obj:`numpy.arccosh`
      for complex inputs.

