Calculate element-wise inverse of hyperbolic cosine of input.

  JAX implementation of :obj:`numpy.arccosh`.

  The inverse of hyperbolic cosine is defined by:

  .. math::

    arccosh(x) = \ln(x + \sqrt{x^2 - 1})

  Args:
